-- Assembly opening audit. Reviewed construction boundaries:
-- polynomial/quotient CFN and presentation comparison; coefficient
-- evaluation (including its quotient implementation) and dual evaluation;
-- mapping-out equivalences, their named comparison chains, actual
-- localisations and Jacobian presentations; finite cover specialization.
-- The nine shared *4 modules change only qualification of the existing
-- HomogeneousMatrices4.Matrices record; their inherited constructions
-- are included so the full union is audited with those qualifications.
